	"data": "Concept: Time-Based Task Analysis\n\nWhat It Is\nTrack how tasks evolve from first mention to completion across the entire audio journal history. Cross-reference tasks across years of journals — when was \"build a portfolio site\" first mentioned? How many times? Did it evolve? Did it die?\n\nWhy It Matters\nThe audio journal corpus is a longitudinal record of cithoreal's thinking spanning years. This analysis would reveal:\nRecurring ideas that never shipped (candidates for serious attention or…",
